#: ../../source/psl_README.md:5
msgid ""
"`psl` is a `JavaScript` domain name parser based on the [Public Suffix "
"List](https://publicsuffix.org/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/psl_README.md:8
msgid ""
"This implementation is tested against the [test data hosted by "
"Mozilla](http://mxr.mozilla.org/mozilla-"
"central/source/netwerk/test/unit/data/test_psl.txt?raw=1) and kindly "
"provided by [Comodo](https://www.comodo.com/)."
msgstr ""

