#: ../../source/psl_README.md:96
msgid "`psl.parse(domain)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/psl_README.md:98
msgid ""
"Parse domain based on Public Suffix List. Returns an `Object` with the "
"following properties:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/psl_README.md:101
msgid "`tld`: Top level domain (this is the _public suffix_)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/psl_README.md:102
msgid "`sld`: Second level domain (the first private part of the domain name)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/psl_README.md:103
msgid "`domain`: The domain name is the `sld` + `tld`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/psl_README.md:104
msgid "`subdomain`: Optional parts left of the domain."
msgstr ""

